(7686646, 1258223, 33182, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> Look at you tossing one in the mix, and it made your profile Top 4!  Been a while.  Hope you guys are doing well up your way. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks. It''s been a while for sure. I don''t really take many photos anymore. At least none that I do anything with. I switched from portraiture to landscape for a while (doing the NH 48 4,000 footers). Now I mostly only take personal photos. I do have one wedding later this year, but it''s for a friend. <br/> <br/>Hope life''s been treating you well.</td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: Look at you tossing one in the mix, and it made your profile Top 4!  Been a while.  Hope you guys are doing well up your way.   Thanks. It''s been a while for sure. I don''t really take many photos anymore. At least none that I do anything with. I switched from portraiture to landscape for a while (doing the NH 48 4,000 footers). Now I mostly only take personal photos. I do have one wedding later this year, but it''s for a friend.  Hope life''s been treating you well.', '2021-02-10 18:42:27.000000', NULL, 0),
